WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.380
How did you find out that you are a descendant of the GU272?

2
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.380
I think I found out later than some of the others.

3
00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:13.220
I didn’t know anything about it until, like, April of last year.

4
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:17.060
So it’s only . . . It hasn’t even been a full year yet.

5
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:22.400
But I found out because my brother Earle in Atlanta was sending me an email.

6
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.660
I think he found out from another cousin.

7
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:32.820
And he started sending just an email with a link in it, and it didn’t say what it was.

8
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:36.160
So I ignored it the first couple times I got his email.

9
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.740
And he would say, “Did you read the email?”

10
00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.220
And I would say, “Mmm.”

11
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.280
And then he finally called and said, “Listen, you need to read this!”

12
00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:48.600
And so once he called, and I started reading it, I was like, well, oh my God!

13
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.880
Oh my God, what is this?

14
00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.320
Is this really us?

15
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:59.120
Because it had the direct connection of Hawkins, and you know, that was my mother’s maiden name.

16
00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.500
I knew right away that there was something there.

17
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.240
Something real, and that this was us.

18
00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:08.540
As the daughter of her daughter.

19
00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.520
They were talking about us!
